                          (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753321\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753201\">7040E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753323\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753205\">7040H10</a></p><p>Remove the complete third brake light as\ndescribed int he procedure:</p><p><a href=\"#/2752991\">5550D16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752921\">5050C34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753118\">7015A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752922\">5050C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753171\">7035B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752829\">4450B12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753309\">7055B90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753310\">7055B91</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752987\">5550C22</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p>Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Tailgate coupling</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D85</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Remove the cable pass from its seating on the tailgate.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046923.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>Secure the connectors to the\nwiring using suitable adhesive tape, so as to be able to remove\nthem easily from the tailgate framework.</p><p>Secure the end of the cable to a probe.</p><p>1. Withdraw the wiring from the hole on the tailgate and, with the\nhelp of a second operator, work through the rear window centring\nhole located on the left and push the wiring so that it is not engaged\non the tailgate framework.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>It is important to use a tool\nwith no sharp or cutting edges i order to avoid damaging the wiring, bodywork\nor painted parts.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046924.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connectors (1a), (1b), (1c), (1d),\n(1e), (1f) and (1g).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Driver&#x27;s Head Bag</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>Q40</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Side Bag  Head Bag earth</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>C53A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Rear right light cluster</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>F31</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Aerial amplifier/power supply</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>P25</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1e</p></td><td><p>Rear left light cluster</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>F30</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\